          "doc": "Registers a component type by name, or returns the existing id if already registered. A repeated name must describe the same layout as its first registration. With \u0060fields\u0060 the two are compared field by field; without it, only \u0060element_size\u0060 is compared, which a same-size field swap or a reordering satisfies.",
